# These are my config files

## Install config

`rake install`

## Outside of rake task

* Copy package list
* Copy /usr/old_lib
* Check `IgnorePkg` in /etc/pacman.conf
* Copy /etc/hosts
* Copy .zshrc-local
* Copy yay
* Copy code/*
* Copy ssh keys
* Copy ~/.ssh/config
* Copy /etc/sudoers

## Install Arch Repo Packages

`yay -S --needed - < pkglist-YYYY-MM-DD`

## Other steps

`sudo systemctl enable systemd-boot-update.service`
